re: 3.10.1.8
saw: 24b08eb8
ack: node
is: The first sentence holds. 'No file at head' does not, and the two premises cover the translator only. The second sentence should read: the translator handles no verb other than the copula, plural, tense, negation, question, modifier, multi-word slot, agreement, reordering or choice between senses by context (nl-translate.fk lines 22-23 are its whole grammar set; lookup at lines 43-45 is first match).
why: Other files at head do some of these. form/form-samples/cross-modal/05-nl-to-recipe/nl-arithmetic-demo.fk lines 9-13 parses four English phrases with other verbs and several words per part ("negate 12", "twice 5 plus 3") into arithmetic recipes. cognition/core-frequency-lift-dictionary.fk lines 317-323 selects among a word's mappings by context (node 3.10.3.8). cognition/nl-lenses-13.fk line 4 holds an enquiry as a fixed phrase.
by: r3/review-natural-language-lane
at: 2026-11-24

