why: 'Eleven tongues' is the removed file's header (line 8), written before Sanskrit (comment at line 95: 14th door, added 2026-07-17) and Persian (comments at lines 80 and 152: 2026-09-10) were added. The study read lines 1-70, which end inside the seventh lexicon.
